OL,3,GNEWSATeen led police pursuit days after
OL,4,Ajudge's warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA banned teenage driver who led police
OL,7,Fon a high speed pursuit days after
OL,8,Fbeing given a suspended sentence for
OL,9,Fthe same offence has been detained for
OL,10,F22 months.
OL,12,FOn 19 June Alfie Ford, 19, was detained
OL,13,Ffor 15 months suspended for two years
OL,14,Ffor a police pursuit in March in which
OL,15,Fhe reached 104mph in a 40mph zone,
OL,16,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,18,FEleven days later police spotted him at
OL,19,Fthe wheel again and another pursuit
OL,20,Fensued. Judge Robert Spragg said Ford
OL,21,Fwould have been warned in "clear terms"
OL,22,Fwhat would happen if he re-offended.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
