OL,3,GNEWSATeen led police pursuit days after
OL,4,Ajudge's warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FFord, of Green Lane in South Shields,
OL,7,Fhad denied dangerous driving and
OL,8,Fdriving while disqualified and without
OL,9,Finsurance, but was found guilty by
OL,10,Fmagistrates.
